Package: xios-core
Name: Xios Desktop Core
Version: 0.1.4
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: Max Leiter <maxwell.leiter@gmail.com>
Author: Max Leiter <maxwell.leiter@gmail.com>
Section: Desktop
Priority: optional
Depends: firmware (>= 16.0), com.max.xios (>= 0.1.2), iosc (>= 0.9.33), iosc-shell (>= 0.9.11), angle (>= 2.1.0+git20260630.a32d31d+es3-14), dbus, xios-desktop-defaults, xios-audio-server, xios-session (>= 1.0.60), xios-launcher-tools (>= 0.1.4)
Recommends: pulseaudio, xios-desktop-theme
MinimumOSVersion: 16.0.0
Description: shared base for every Xios desktop flavor
 The common foundation that every Xios desktop flavor builds on: the Xios
 display app, the iosc Wayland compositor, the ANGLE GPU stack (OpenGL ES on
 Metal), the D-Bus message bus, desktop audio, and the ambient distro defaults
 (fonts, locale, XDG paths, retina display profile). It also installs the
 session launcher and the iosc desktop shell.
 .
 Install one of the flavor packages instead of this one: xios-gnome,
 xios-kde, xios-native, or xios-x11. Each pulls in xios-core automatically.
 .
 The display app needs AppSync Unified to launch. Rootless jailbreaks only
 (/var/jb). Target profile: @REPO_PROFILE@.
